-- Published Sydney towers, to check the LiDAR blocks against.
-- Heights: Wikipedia, List of tallest buildings in Sydney (read 2026-11-04). "top": to the highest
-- architectural point; "roof": where the list gives a roof height. Built after the August 2018 survey:
-- marked "after survey" (the LiDAR should show them part-built or missing).
-- Places: each building's English Wikipedia article (archived 2017 copy where the live one has none,
-- checked against SkyscraperPage or Structurae), looked up by a helper agent (Claude, Opus 5.5).
-- Architecture: Tom Dyer. These words: Claude (Opus 5.5).

